<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa sees 215.3 mln-real inflow in Oct.</title>
<headline>Bovespa sees 215.3 mln-real inflow in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it registered net foreign capital inflows of 215.3 million reais in the first 18 days of October.</p>
<p>Foreign buys amounted to 1.696 billion reais versus foreign sells of 1.481 billion reais, it said.</p>
<p>In September, the Bovespa saw net capital inflows of 450.9 million reais, it said.</p>
<p>So far this year, net foreign capital inflows have totalled 2.246 billion reais, the bolsa said.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 232 4411</p>
